;; Kaocha config for `clojure -M:test`.
;;
;; The ^:live namespaces (contract-runner, consistency, mutation, property,
;; memory-conformance) open a MilvusMemoryStore on localhost:19530 and need a
;; running Milvus. Without one they fail on an open circuit, so a bare
;; `clojure -M:test` could not gate a branch. They are skipped here, exactly
;; as CI already runs them (`clojure -M:test --skip-meta :live`).
;;
;; Run the live suite against a reachable Milvus with:
;;   clojure -M:test --config-file tests-live.edn
#kaocha/v1
{:tests [{:id         :unit
          :test-paths ["test"]
          :skip-meta  [:live]}]}
